Z||000015||88CoupeV6||07-26-2001||04:55 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BOILERMAKER:<BR><B>Do you even have 200 miles on your coupe, Scott?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Sure, I've driven to  the Carlisle show 450 miles each way, and to OOB Maine, and a show in NH and in RI, I also cruise around on the weekends.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||7
